###

### Get Me
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### PROFILE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Add Address
POST {{base}}/profile/address
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "neighborhood": "Narjiss",
  "street": "Rue Ibn Khaldoun",
  "details": "Appart 3, 2ème étage"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### CATALOGUE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Catalogue
GET {{base}}/api/catalogue

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### COMMANDE VOCALE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Text Basket
POST {{base}}/api/text-basket
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texte": "3 kg de btata w kilo d tomates"
}

###

### Voice Basket (multipart)
POST {{base}}/api/voice-basket
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="commande.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./commande.wav
------Boundary--
